\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The announcements didn\u8217 t mention last weekend\u8217 s protests in Shanghai, Beijing and at least six other cities against the human cost of anti-virus restrictions that confine millions of people to their homes. But the timing and publicity suggested President Xi Jinping's government was trying to mollify public anger after some protesters made the politically explosive demand that Xi resign.}
